  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I have some avatars favorited that are iOS compatible because of the conversion that happened about a month or two ago, but I can't actually use some of the avatars that were converted because their performance rank is Very Poor.\n\nAll I ask is that if this conversion happens again, either make sure that people can actually use the avatars, or give us an option to use/see the Very Poor avatars by choice and not force an option. \n\nI understand if this might have been an experiment, but it sucks that I can't use about 70% of the iOS compatible avatars that I have favorited.",
